{"articleNo":"99769","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=99769&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014년도 삼성드림클래스 주중교실 추가선발 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.03","hit":"5750","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">삼성드림클래스 주중교실 추가선발 공고</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\">저소득층 중학생 학습지원에 동참할 삼성드림클래스 대학생 강사를 아래와 같이 추가 선발합니다. 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 선발대상 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\">중학생 학습지도가 가능한 대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※&nbsp;휴학생 지원 가능(추가 선발 지역에 한함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※&nbsp;대학원생, 8학기이상 초과이수자, 입학예정자 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 활동기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014.3月 ~ 2014.8月 末(활동우수자는 再선발時 우대)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 1학년 담당 강사는 4月 中 수업 시작</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 선발내용 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 59.78pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 21.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 359.76pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 21.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">주중교실</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 59.78pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 21.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span sty