00 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 359.76pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 21.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">-중학생 대상 1:10 영어/수학 학습 지도</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 처 우 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\">시간당 37,500원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 대학교를 통해&nbsp;삼성드림클래스 장학금으로 지급, 他 장학금과 중복수혜 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 지원자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- '14年 8月까지 지속적으로 활동이 가능한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(활동기간 內 실습, 인턴, 연수 등으로 활동이 어려운 자는 지원 불가)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;평균학점&nbsp;3.0점(4.5만점) 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 기본 인품과&nbsp;리더십을 갖추고 봉사정신이 뛰어난 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 영어/수학 분야의 지식이 풍부하고 강의 능력이 우수한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 기타사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기초생활수급자&nbsp;및 차상위계층은 선발時 우대</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 활동기간 종료후에도 우수강사는 再선발時 우대</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 선발일정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 128.52pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 21.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 139.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 21.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT